{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"它清楚串起了“眼前的满足→想让亲近延续→意识到不能只凭自己的喜欢决定→急切无处落实”的因果链，也用放不下的需要解释了舒适中的阻力；但身体状态如何先于念头发生变化、急切为何在此刻短暂冒头，以及安稳如何暂时改变感受，交代得不够具体。\",\n    \"乙\": \"它既解释了安稳为何能让身体先放松、使人沉入漂浮的余韵，也说明了热烈退去后为何转而想确认对方心意，以及缺少答案为何让急切短暂浮现又沉回去；但后段关于时间流逝、连续性松动和等待收紧的推演有所重复，部分因果联系也比前面的解释更间接，H/M标签本身并不增加解释力。\",\n    \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n    \"why\": \"乙的实质增量是说明了身体先松动、安稳暂时缓解悬空感却不能消除不确定性，以及这种未解决的需要如何重新影响感受，而非单纯增加叙事长度，因此即使部分推演较繁复，也没有削弱其对核心转折的解释。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "11024948-8d0a-43f4-b0bb-4cb9e32c6379", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T132908477952Z", "elapsed_seconds": 98.75, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:30:47.227996+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3846ea323253de0be3e6c90cdccd3f1d5eda76704291808893c0de18cf5375eb", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\